{"id": "EUVD-2026-107237", "enisaUuid": "ac63787f-2a70-3a94-8d3a-d218511899b3", "description": "Chamilo LMS from 2.0.0-alpha.1 before 2.0.0-RC.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in legacy AJAX handlers under public/main/inc/ajax/ that exposes user names and certificates. Unauthenticated or low-privileged users can call actions like get_users_by_group_course, user_by_all_roles, and export_all_certificates to harvest user names and other learners' certificate PDFs.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T12:39:46", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T13:28:08", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/issues/7671", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/2861afd4896ff898a950302f2c00f44726fa6f0a", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/releases/tag/v2.0.0-RC.3", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/blob/v2.0.0-RC.2/public/main/inc/ajax/course.ajax.php#L350-L426", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/blob/v2.0.0-RC.2/public/main/inc/ajax/usergroup.ajax.php#L17-L50", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/blob/v2.0.0-RC.2/public/main/inc/ajax/gradebook.ajax.php#L58-L99", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/chamilo-lms-2.0.0-alpha.1-before-2.0.0-rc.3-missing-authorization-in-ajax-handlers"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-114390", "GHSA-h28r-m2q7-jx9p"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5232d84a-1b15-325f-bc0f-045fb3c2860d", "product": {"name": "chamilo-lms", "vendor": {"name": "Chamilo"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0-alpha.1 <2.0.0-RC.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "74081b03-764f-3f1c-880d-c036a9715bd8", "vendor": {"name": "Chamilo"}}], "isExploited": false}